'''Justin Ridge''' was the Supervising Director and Executive Producer for ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]'', who provides the voice for [[R1-J5|Bucket]]. He was also an episodic [[Wikipedia:Animation director|director]] and [[Wikipedia:Storyboard|storyboard]] artist for ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]'', a [[Wikipedia:Computer-generated imagery|CGI]] television series that debuted [[October 3]], [[2008]] on [[Cartoon Network]] as a continuation of the [[Star Wars: The Clone Wars (film)|film of the same name]], released two months prior. Like the series' showrunner, [[Dave Filoni]], Ridge was also previously an assistant director, [[Wikipedia:Screenplay|screenplay]], and [[Wikipedia:Storyboard|storyboard]] artist for [[Wikipedia:Avatar: The Last Airbender|''Avatar: The Last Airbender'']].

